OL,3,AAlgeria to send troops to Niger in
OL,4,Afirst foreign deployment since 1973
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlgeria is to send troops to Niger in
OL,7,Fits first foreign deployment since
OL,8,Fsending forces to Egypt during the
OL,9,FArab-Israeli war in 1973.
OL,11,FThe deployment follows a visit to
OL,12,FAlgiers by Niger's defence minister, as
OL,13,Fthe country seeks support against armed
OL,14,Fgroups, some of which are linked to
OL,15,Fal-Qaeda or Islamic State.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
