OL,3,AAlgeria to send troops to Niger in
OL,4,Afirst foreign deployment since 1973
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlgeria has economic interests in
OL,7,FNiger, including a planned gas pipeline
OL,8,Fthat would carry Nigerian gas through
OL,9,FNiger to Algeria. The troops are
OL,10,Fexpected to protect energy facilities
OL,11,Fin northern Niger, near the Libyan
OL,12,Fborder.
OL,14,FThe deployment comes as the two
OL,15,Fneighbours rebuild ties after a
OL,16,Fdiplomatic rift in 2025, when Niger
OL,17,Frecalled its ambassador to Algiers.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
